  "info": {
    "title": "Runnelix development API",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Phase 1 loopback-only API. No authentication. Workspace paths scope data but do not authorize users. Use fake data. The runtime records admission only; accepted does not mean executed. Browser Origin headers are rejected. Request JSON <=256 KiB; admitted input and resolved mock-node payloads <=8 KiB. No list or pagination API yet. A literal loopback Host header is required."
  },
